 special \"room events\" for you.Uncosy has reached a level of polish that I always wanted to achieve but never expected to get to, and I'm very proud to be sharing it with the world.Thank you!A huge thank you to anyone who's dropped a wis","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:00:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690938","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5078760-1845383656395090","game_id":"steam-5078760","kind":"update","title":"Update v0.58.3 Shinies!","summary":"Hey everyone!I'm very excited about this update, I've been working hard on it in preparation for Next Fest and it's got some of the features that I've always wanted but never quite had time for. This will likely be the final content update for release, I hope you enjoy it!NewShinies: Added new, extremely rare, golden plushies. When you catch one for the first time you also unlock a new floor decoration to memorialize the moment.Room: Added a \"!\" marker over every newly bought decor slot so you c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T02:32:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656395090","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5078760-1844115010497017","game_id":"steam-5078760","kind":"update","title":"Update v0.54.0 Floor Décor","summary":"FeaturesFloor Décor: Added two new décor slots in the corners of the room with several new decoration itemsBugfixescreatures in the machine are now randomized based on your runs seedthe radio no longer plays over the end creditskeeper is now audible in the roomfixed a change to rng that made the same song play all the time","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-19T11:32:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010497017","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5078760-1844115010493933","game_id":"steam-5078760","kind":"update","title":"Update v0.54.0 Bench Décor","summary":"FeaturesBench Décor: Added a room slot on the bench next to the PC.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-18T06:37:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010493933","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5078760-1844115010493418","game_id":"steam-5078760","kind":"update","title":"Update v0.53.0 Room decoration","summary":"FeaturesPC: There is a new \"ROOM\" app on the PC that will let you unlock décor for The Room.Wall Décor: There are 8 slots to place wall hangings, in this version I have included some posters and neon signs. More to come!Display Shelf: There is an expandable display shelf which you can place your favourite plushies on for safe keeping.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-17T22:36:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010493418","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5078760-1844115010487705","game_id":"steam-5078760","kind":"update","title":"Update v0.51.1 Achievements!","summary":"AchievementsYou will now earn achievements as you progress through the game.You can view your completed and pending achievements, including your progress toward them from the PC in the new achievements app.Any progress you make in the demo will come into the full game on release, including completed achievements.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-15T23:22:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010487705","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5078760-1843481262700493","game_id":"steam-5078760","kind":"update","title":"Update v0.48.0 New skills and balancing","summary":"The skill treeThere's a very pretty new skill tree layout. Progression should be clearer, and it should be easier to explore.There are 5 new passive skills:Token Thrift: 10% / 20% / 30% chance a pull doesn't use up the loaded token.Fewer Challenges: Challenge rounds appear at 80% / 65% / 50% of their usual rate.Curse Relief: A cursed catch sells for more.Chain Bonus: Every ten catches in a row raises the bonus.Sneak Peek: Holds the field still before the the catch attempt giving you a chance to ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T01:23:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262700493","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5078760-1843481262691790","game_id":"steam-5078760","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.43.0: Claw Fusion!","summary":"Featuresfusion: Fuse claws together to combine their abilitiesUIloadout tray UI reworked to allow for more clawsPC UI layout updated to allow for new Fusion appBugfixTokens use their new names in the shop","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T10:35:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262691790","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5078760-1842846814452187","game_id":"steam-5078760","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.42.0: QoL and UI","summary":"Steamsteam: Added Steam Cloud saves.steam: the wishlist button opens the store page in the Steam overlay instead of leaving the game Featuresui: name the quality tiers and retire Tier and T from every screencatch: badge to show when there's new claws and tokens in the loadoutcatch: pause before a challenge round before it starts to let the player read how to play hud: colour the wanted item by its rarityhud: track the current ask under the walletui: colour the reward card's rarity and qualityui:","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-07T05:05:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814452187","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5078760-1842846814450180","game_id":"steam-5078760","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.41.0: New Claw!","summary":"Claw updatesTighter Grip (new) — gives the player a chance to improve catch quality at the cost of harder catches.Rare Focus / Very Rare Focus (reworked) — focus on a specific rarity, making them appear more frequently. All catches are now cursed.Advantage (reworked) — the Advantage claw now rerolls plushies. A new animation shows what's happening.Every claw now has its own art on the machine, and the claw you had equipped stays equipped when you load. The catch minigameWent from only ever showi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-06T04:35:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814450180","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5078760-1842212951302541","game_id":"steam-5078760","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.36.1: Demo fixes","summary":"Hi everyone, first of all thanks to everyone who's played t